  "details": "The name is self explanatory, provide a component, either separately or built into the Avatar Descriptor, that allows setting a custom scale value on the avatar, which will make this avatar defaults to that scale on upload. (e.g. If the user set the default scale at 1.10, then the avatar would revert to that after being reset or loaded for the first time)\n\nI know Unity scale is an option, but this can potentially break some avatars and I am not very fond of it personally. Hence why I opened this feature request suggestion.",
